  concept: "Authored objective: Start with timer discharged.\nAuthored requirement:
    Recorded from the solved timer voltage and motor state during the jam test. voltage
    \u2265 4.8 V. voltage \u2264 5.2 V.\nGeneral teaching principle: Capacitor voltage
    and current vary with circuit state; transient observations need a stated time
    and reference.\nOnly fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish that this
    objective is complete."
  analogy: A storage tank illustrates temporary storage, but electrical capacitance
    has precise circuit equations.
